response_content_full:
Tyson originally runs 5000 meters per day. Running 1/5 times more means an increase of 1/5 of 5000 meters, which is 1000 meters. Thus, his new daily distance is 5000 + 1000 = 6000 meters.

June has 30 days, so the total distance covered in June is 6000 meters/day × 30 days = 180,000 meters.

